      "structuredContent": {
        "url": "https://github.com/ajt60gaibb/OpenProblemsInNLA/pull/365",
        "number": 365,
        "state": "open",
        "merged": false,
        "mergeable": true,
        "draft": true,
        "body": "RA-05 has a reviewed exact statement but no complete Lean proof. This adds eleven proved support exports: nonnegative costs, an exact attained minimum support and worst-case inclusion, and the all-dimensional reduction from strong original-row coresets to arbitrary-weight all-vector ℓp energy preservation. It includes empty rows, zero test vectors and dimension one in the stated domains.\n\nThe full `Classification ∧ NegativeAnswer` remains unproved; RA-05 stays Solved. The canonical page, all 217 permanent ID/path pairs, published definitions and separately frozen Target are preserved. Original/specification/manuscript copies are byte-bound to published main. The proof-source inventory moves RA-05 from statement-only to partial support.\n\nBoth components received two independent pre-proof reviews and independent final reviews. A fresh 11-module package replay, all eleven LeanCert kernel assertions, generated theorem-kind audits, and eleven exact statement plus eleven transitive-axiom comparisons through the unchanged pinned Comparator library pass. Every export has only propext, Classical.choice and Quot.sound. The local numerical kernel control was also rebuilt from 131 pinned LeanCert modules and passed explicit `leancert (trust := kernel)`.\n\nValidation: metadata/Comparator coverage passes for all eleven exports; 30 metadata/selector tests, 17 permanent-ID tests, 15 portable harness tests, nine Comparator controls and seven runtime controls pass. The unchanged Linux workflow selects only RA-05 and will supply the authoritative sandbox/exporter/raw-kernel receipt for immutable commit aacc8f307a6fc4dcea2c74e720d33bbe381d9085. Local macOS evidence is explicitly labelled and is not a Linux verification claim.\n\nThe updated source audit still identifies 38 Solved targets lacking full Lean proofs. This is a support checkpoint in that campaign, not a full-target promotion.",
        "title": "RA-05: prove exact minimum-support and hyperplane reductions",
